<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MORGAN CUTS DRUG-SECTOR WEIGHTING.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MORGAN CUTS DRUG-SECTOR WEIGHTING.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it had cut its recommended portfolio weighting of the drug sector from overweight to market weight.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
